gWJ(){return"Trying every way of breaking pieces, the silhouette is only reached if the outlined piece is broken. It is marked with a cross."},
gWK(){return"Trying every way of breaking pieces, the silhouette is only reached if the outlined piece stays whole. I made it unbreakable."},
gWI(){return"Every piece still standing is already known: break the ones marked with a cross."},
WL(a){return"A piece that was broken shouldn't have been: the silhouette can no longer be reached. Undo "+a+" to go back before that mistake."},
